+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+While the external HUD is connected, `ShowCameraWithCluster=0` skips the on-device camera/path rendering and turns off the device display after the interaction timeout. A tap wakes it temporarily; medium/full alerts, unavailable alert status, or HUD disconnection wake it again. `1` keeps the device camera and display visible. Camera capture and model input continue with `0`.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
